{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cascade is a game which has interactive simulated fluids and landscapes you can modify while on a mission or in the level editor. Use aircraft, boats, wheeled vehicles, horses, snowmobiles, Choose a creative mode or an mission driven path with challenges that include drones, turrets, monsters, bases to attack.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are single player missions that involve first person characters, horse back, aircraft, driving, boats and more. these involve\u00a0 challenges of exploration, quests, attack, divert rivers etc, fun !\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The level editor allows you to :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modify landscapes and the fluids will update in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add simulated fluid sources that will follow the landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add large volumed of liquids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change the landscape auto material.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paint trees and grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place objects that interact with the fluids - rocks, buildings, bridges, floatable objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place enemies like drones, turrets, monsters etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore your creation on foot, on horseback, in an aircraft, wheeled vehicles, boats, submarines, snowmobile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create rivers, seas, and also\u00a0 mix different fluids ( water, mud, mercury, lava, honey. goop, and more)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paint with fluids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add drains to control the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create dams then burst them or divert the fluid anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546500?t=1741958454","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546500?t=1741958454","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546500/c2ec28b468affbe4231bad6f8ce9639680ccb7ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741958454","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546500/c2ec28b468affbe4231bad6f8ce9639680ccb7ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741958454","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cascade is a game which has interactive simulated fluids and landscapes you can modify while on a mission or in the level editor. Use aircraft, boats, wheeled vehicles, horses, snowmobiles, Choose a creative mode or an mission driven path with challenges that include drones, turrets, monsters, bases to attack.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are single player missions that involve first person characters, horse back, aircraft, driving, boats and more. these involve\u00a0 challenges of exploration, quests, attack, divert rivers etc, fun !\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The level editor allows you to :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modify landscapes and the fluids will update in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add simulated fluid sources that will follow the landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add large volumed of liquids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change the landscape auto material.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paint trees and grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place objects that interact with the fluids - rocks, buildings, bridges, floatable objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place enemies like drones, turrets, monsters etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore your creation on foot, on horseback, in an aircraft, wheeled vehicles, boats, submarines, snowmobile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create rivers, seas, and also\u00a0 mix different fluids ( water, mud, mercury, lava, honey. goop, and more)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paint with fluids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add drains to control the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create dams then burst them or divert the fluid anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Cascade Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546500/aa4850efa94776d492c1a70623438fdbb48edebf/header.jpg?t=1741958454","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257110257,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110257/movie480.mp4?t=1741887777","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110257/movie_max.mp4?t=1741887777"},"name":"Cascade mission 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257110257/f43f8da22b06af5c59c62df6975a34f74f461859/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741887777","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110257/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741887777","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110257/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741887777"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257109899,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com